// Cycle of Life: Realistic Fauna — Cats (cats).
//
// Four small felids in four coat/species variants: house cat, ocelot, serval, and European wildcat.
//
// STRUCTURAL NOTE — why every entry appears twice. This mod gives cat-male AND cat-female their own
// spawn conditions, and it encodes the sex in the entity CODE rather than on a "gender" variant axis.
// Our species key only collapses axes literally named age/gender/sex, so each cat becomes TWO species
// (cats:cat-male-serval and cats:cat-female-serval) instead of one. Both still work — a unit's members
// are sexed internally, so each half breeds and sustains itself — but the pair would otherwise carry
// DOUBLE the intended density. So carryingCapacity is set to half the population we want per cell on
// each half, and the two halves add back up to it. Anything else (lifecycle, diet) is simply stated
// identically on both.
//
// All four are true felids, and felids are documented surplus killers — the reason a fox-proof
// henhouse is not a cat-proof one. They all carry a huntWhenFull floor; the house cat carries the
// highest, since a well-fed domestic cat is the textbook example of killing for its own sake.
//
// VERIFICATION STATUS: the species keys in this file were derived from the mod's own entity
// JSON (its spawn conditions and variant axes), not read off a live server roster — this mod
// is not installed on the pack author's server. A key that turned out wrong does not break
// anything: an overlay entry that matches no species is simply ignored, and the animal keeps
// its auto-discovered values. If you run this mod, `/col species` (or the roster dumped to the
// server log at startup) lists the authoritative keys, and anything mistyped here will be
// absent from it. Corrections welcome.
{
  "species": {

    // ---- House cat: feral/farmyard. Prolific (several litters a year), short-lived in the wild,
    // and the most notorious surplus killer of the four. ----
    "cats:cat-male-house": {
      "carryingCapacity": 2, "bodyWeight": 4, "growthRate": 0.6, "predationVulnerability": 0.6,
      "preyPerPredator": 1, "huntWhenFull": 0.35,
      "preyMaxBodyWeight": 2, "preyMinBodyWeight": 0.01, "lifecycle": { "lifespanDays": 1800, "gestationDays": 65, "litterSizeMin": 3, "litterSizeMax": 5, "breedingMonths": [4, 7], "juvenileMortality": 0.55 }
    },
    "cats:cat-female-house": {
      "carryingCapacity": 2, "bodyWeight": 4, "growthRate": 0.6, "predationVulnerability": 0.6,
